{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05354","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 源乾曜","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匈奴迩河朔，汉地须戎旅。\n天子择英才，朝端出监抚。\n流星下阊阖，宝钺专公辅。\n礼物生光辉，宸章备恩诩。\n有征视矛戟，制胜唯樽俎。\n彼美何壮哉，桓桓擅斯举。\n声华振台阁，功德标文武。\n奉国知命轻，忘家以身许。\n安人在勤恤，保大殚襟俯。\n此外无异言，同情报明主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}